\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\)</span> is the natural-deduction derivability\nrelation generated by <a href=\"?unresolved=70-df-2-2\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-4\" data-link-target=\"70-df-2-2\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">70-df-2-2<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intuitionistic\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IPC}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}mid\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}intuitionistic\\text{-}propositional\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{IPC}\n\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}mid\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{IPC}}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IPC}\">\\(\\mathrm{IPC}\\)</span> 在这里是无假设可推导公式的集合，而不是一个未定型\n的“IPC 运算符”。</li>\n<li>该别名把跨书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span> 统一成本书其余原子使用\n的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{IPC}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"70-df-2-1","status":"missing","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[70-df-2-1]]","embed":false},{"target":"70-df-2-2","status":"miss